    "content": "<!-- layout: title; theme: briefing; design: v1 -->\n# Checking an application\n\nSynthetic source review. [1]\n\n---\n\n<!-- layout: flow -->\n## Collection precedes the completeness check [1]\n\n1. **Collect**: retain the application. [1]\n2. **Check**: determine whether required information is complete. [1]\n\nThe check leads to alternative actions; both outcomes are not consecutive steps. [1]",
